# Stack

- Next.js App Router only (no extra backend or database)
- Data lives in `data/db.json`; read/write through `lib/db.ts`
- HTTP API: `GET/POST /api/items`, `PATCH/DELETE /api/items/[id]`
- UI is RTL Persian in `app/page.tsx`
- Production: Vercel, auto-deploys from `main` (`https://mostafaapp.vercel.app`)
- Prefer editing existing files over adding new libraries
